{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22250","headline":"湖亭晚望残水 · 白居易","name":"湖亭晚望残水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖上秋泬寥，湖边晚萧瑟。\n登亭望湖水，水缩湖底出。\n清渟得早霜，明灭浮残日。\n流注随地势，洼坳无定质。\n泓澄白龙卧，宛转青蛇屈。\n破镜折劒头，光芒又非一。\n久爲山水客，见尽幽奇物。\n及来湖亭望，此状难谈悉。\n乃知天地间，胜事殊未毕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}